    title: "Taxonomy coverage gap: 32 registered analyzer languages have no LanguageSpec (gleam, hack, odin, ansible, ...) -- declared no_taxonomy_spec by WI-juzig; disposition each: add spec, fold into parent, or keep as declared dialect"  # a13a
